---
source: crates/specforge-cli/tests/extension_surfaces.rs
expression: help
---
How many of a release's deliverables are shipped, as a count and a ratio in [0, 1] (null without deliverables).

Usage: specforge product release-completion [OPTIONS] <RELEASE>

Arguments:
  <RELEASE>
          The release id

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
